{
  "title": "Honeyed Indian Figs Kheer",
  "description": "A comforting, pungent, and flaky Indian dessert featuring sweet figs in a soffritto-based kheer. This kheer is an ideal treat for a lazy Sunday.",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
  "diet": [
    "vegetarian",
